    "body": "Please also add `armhf` as starship also distributes binaries for that architecture.\r\n```suggestion\r\n  - build-on: arm64\r\n  - build-on: armhf\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nI don't know if they build right now but you could also add `s390x` and `ppc64el`, but with `build-error: ignore`?\r\nI think that's the syntax:\r\n```suggestion\r\n  - build-on: arm64\r\n  - build-on: armhf\r\n  - build-on: s390x\r\n    build-error: ignore\r\n  - build-on: ppc64el\r\n    build-error: ignore\r\n```",
